# Text is stored and checked out LF on every platform, .import sidecars
# included (Reformat Games standards, GIT_AND_CI.md "Line endings").
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.exr binary
*.hdr binary
*.glb binary
*.bin binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.res binary
*.scn binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary

# Upstream sources kept byte for byte (their SHA-256 is recorded) go here,
